{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slide":5,"text":"OpenAI prompt caching reuses eligible exact prefixes automatically. Put stable content first and dynamic content last. For GPT-5.6 and later, the guide states a 1,024-token minimum cacheable prompt length. A cache stores reusable processing state—not answers—and cached-token telemetry is the evidence of reuse.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching\n[/Sources]"}
