{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slide":6,"text":"Liu et al. varied the position of the answer-bearing document among 20 retrieved documents. In the published example shown, accuracy was strongest near the beginning and improved again near the end, with weaker results through much of the middle. The implication is not that every model has the same curve; it is that fit and use must be evaluated separately.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\n[/Sources]"}
